    {
      "text": "This guide is for admins only. If you are an end user, contact your organization’s administrator for deployment-related details."
    },
    {
      "text": "With Jamf Pro, you can configure and deploy Digital Experience (ZDX) for iOS devices. Before following this guide, ensure that Zscaler Client Connector is installed on your device. To learn more, see Deploying Zscaler Client Connector with Jamf Pro for iOS."
    },
    {
      "text": "This deployment guide applies to devices running iOS version 16 and later. To learn more, see Supported Versions & Feature Compatibility."
    },
    {
